<apex:page standardController="NOC__c" extensions="CapriNocPdfController"
           renderAs="pdf" showHeader="false" sidebar="false"
           standardStylesheets="false" applyHtmlTag="false" applyBodyTag="false">
    <html>
    <head>
        <style type="text/css">
            /* Layout follows "CAPRI SWAP LETTER.docx"; the top margin leaves room for the letterhead.
               Add ?relatedId=(Swap History Id) to print a swap other than the NOC's first one. */
            @page { size: A4; margin: 130pt 72pt 40pt 72pt; }
            body { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: #000; line-height: 1.25; }
            p { margin: 0; text-align: left; }
            p.para { margin: 0 0 10pt 0; text-align: justify; }
            .gap { height: 12pt; }
            .right { text-align: right; }
        </style>
    </head>
    <body>
        <apex:outputPanel rendered="{!NOT(ISBLANK(errorMessage))}"><p>{!errorMessage}</p></apex:outputPanel>
        <apex:outputPanel rendered="{!AND(ISBLANK(errorMessage), NOT(hasSwap))}">
            <p>No swap is linked to this NOC.</p>
        </apex:outputPanel>
        <apex:outputPanel rendered="{!AND(ISBLANK(errorMessage), hasSwap)}">
            <p class="right">Date:&#160;<apex:outputText value="{0,date,dd-MM-yyyy}"><apex:param value="{!TODAY()}"/></apex:outputText></p>
            <p>Capri Global Capital Limited</p>
            <p>502, Tower A,</p>
            <p>Peninsula Business Park,</p>
            <p>Senapati Bapat Marg,</p>
            <p>Lower Parel, Mumbai 400 013.</p>
            <div class="gap">&#160;</div>
            <p><b><u>Subject: Swap of Flat No: {!swapHistory.Old_Plot__r.Name} for Flat No: {!swapHistory.New_Plot__r.Name}</u></b></p>
            <div class="gap">&#160;</div>
            <p class="para" style="text-align:left">Dear Sir,</p>
            <p class="para">With reference to inventory list provided along with the Loan agreement / Supplemental and
                Amendatory Loan Agreement between M/s. Capri Global Capital Limited and M/s Ananda Homes dated 28-June-2024;
                the flat no <b>{!swapHistory.Old_Plot__r.Name}</b> was unsold unit (having area
                <b>{!swapHistory.Old_Plot__r.Saleable_Area_Sft__c}</b> sq.ft.).</p>
            <p class="para">The said unit (i.e. <b>{!swapHistory.Old_Plot__r.Name}</b>) was sold to <b>{!swapCustomerNames}</b>.
                We have received a request from <b>{!swapCustomerNames}</b>, stating that they want to SWAP flat no.
                <b>{!swapHistory.Old_Plot__r.Name}</b> forming part of unsold inventory in the aforementioned loan agreement
                (having area <b>{!swapHistory.Old_Plot__r.Saleable_Area_Sft__c}</b> sq.ft.) for flat no.
                <b>{!swapHistory.New_Plot__r.Name}</b> forming part of unsold inventory in the aforementioned loan agreement
                (having area <b>{!swapHistory.New_Plot__r.Saleable_Area_Sft__c}</b> sq.ft.) on account of
                {!swapHistory.Swap_Reason__c}.</p>
            <p class="para">Flat No. <b>{!swapHistory.New_Plot__r.Name}</b> was tentatively allotted to
                <b>{!swapCustomerNames}</b>, however we have neither entered into agreement to sale nor done the
                registration, and no NOC was obtained for the same.
                <apex:outputPanel layout="none" rendered="{!swapReceipts.hasReceipts}">
                    In totality, an amount of <b>Rs. {!swapReceipts.totalText}/-</b> was received from
                    {!swapReceipts.modes} vide Reference. no <b>{!swapReceipts.references}</b>, dated:-
                    <b>{!swapReceipts.dates}</b>. (Said Amount is adjusted against the said unit
                    {!swapHistory.New_Plot__r.Name}).
                </apex:outputPanel></p>
            <p class="para">On account of the above swap arrangement, we confirm that the flat no.
                <b>{!swapHistory.Old_Plot__r.Name}</b> shall form part of unsold inventory. Further, the same shall be
                subject to the same terms which are applicable to unsold inventory as per the loan agreement between
                M/s. Capri Global Capital Limited and M/s Ananda Homes dated 28-June-2024.</p>
            <apex:outputPanel layout="none" rendered="{!showSwapNote}">
                <p class="para" style="text-align:left">Note : <b>{!swapHistory.Old_Plot__r.Name}</b> flat was released from
                    <b>{!swapCustomerNames}</b> and it is allotted as New booking to <b>{!buyerNames}</b>{!buyerMobileSuffix}</p>
            </apex:outputPanel>
            <div style="page-break-inside:avoid">
                <p><b>For M/s Ananda Homes,</b></p>
                <div style="height:50pt">&#160;</div>
                <p><b>Authorised Signatory</b></p>
            </div>
        </apex:outputPanel>
    </body>
    </html>
</apex:page>
